{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924960/extras/a24f7fa80e51d2b4e2930a3216e98a9f.avif?t=1754805618\" width=1600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0You are the prince of a rising empire. Your choices will echo through blood and legacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of the royal heir in <i>Vis Chapter 1</i>, an adult visual novel set in the newly formed kingdom of <strong>Colonia</strong>. Governed by a ruthless king\u2014your father\u2014the realm teeters between growth and destruction, held together by power, secrets, and shifting alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As tension builds, you must navigate not only the political landscape, but also the desires and loyalties of those around you. Discover and deepen relationships with a diverse cast of women, each with their own motivations, secrets, and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will define your legacy. Will you become a just ruler, a feared tyrant, or something darker entirely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge alliances. Corrupt hearts. Rule with fire\u2014or fall to it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924960/extras/9a29de26ff704b6b4130d30078a93d5f.poster.avif?t=1754805618\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924960/extras/9a29de26ff704b6b4130d30078a93d5f.webm?t=1754805618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924960/extras/9a29de26ff704b6b4130d30078a93d5f.mp4?t=1754805618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25<strong> Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0a Voiced Lewd Scenes: </strong>Experience intimate moments like never before with professionally voiced lewd scenes, bringing added depth, tension, and realism to every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Narrative-Driven AVN</strong>: Experience a mature, branching storyline packed with intrigue, power struggles, and adult content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Meaningful Choices</strong>: Shape the world and characters around you with dialogue decisions that affect both relationships and the kingdom\u2019s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Diverse Female Cast</strong>: Interact with multiple fully-rendered characters, each with unique personalities, story arcs, and potential outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Explore Colonia</strong>: Discover the secrets of your kingdom through political maneuvering, exploration, and unexpected events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Cinematic 3D Visuals</strong>: Immerse yourself in high-quality rendered scenes and detailed character models.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd1e <strong>18+ Content</strong>: Contains adult themes, nudity, and strong language. Not suitable for minors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924960/extras/0f5ab19ebd3cff7cd389ba7a00c943e5.poster.avif?t=1754805618\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924960/extras/0f5ab19ebd3cff7cd389ba7a00c943e5.webm?t=1754805618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s